  "text": "Permissions \u00b7 Pair Play\nClose\n\nReview this Space's access.\n\nInternet access\nOn\n\nThis Space can load content from and send data to the internet. It can't reach your Hermes app, your files or other Spaces.\n\nGranted to Pair Play\nOwn data\nAllowed\nScope\nThis Space's records only. Cannot see other Spaces.\nPurpose\nSave and use this Space's data\nData leaves device\nThis grant stays on device. Space-readable data can leave through Internet access or the WebRTC limit when Internet access is off.\nAccess\nContinuing\nRevoke\nDiagnostics\nAllowed\nScope\nError logs from this Space, secrets redacted. Only the latest 2,000 log entries are retained.\nPurpose\nDiagnose and repair this Space\nData leaves device\nNo ordinary network access. The owner can read these logs in chat.\nAccess\nContinuing\nRevoke\nWaiting for your decision\n\nNothing waiting for your decision.\n\nYour canvas and its bot\n\nAsk Hermes in a normal Hermes chat to build or change this canvas, use connected tools, or bring in files. Bot actions follow Hermes's native rules, not extra per-site, per-tool or device permissions here.\n\nCanvas controls that ask their maintaining bot need a working native bot connection. This panel does not submit a bot request.\n\nOwner\nH\nHermes\nAudit\nNov 10, 2026, 10:37 PM CST \u00b7 user \u00b7 decision net \u00b7 granted\nNov 10, 2026, 5:02 PM CST \u00b7 user \u00b7 decision logs \u00b7 granted\nNov 10, 2026, 5:02 PM CST \u00b7 agent:Hermes \u00b7 request logs \u00b7 requested\nNov 10, 2026, 5:02 PM CST \u00b7 user \u00b7 decision data \u00b7 granted\nNov 10, 2026, 5:02 PM CST \u00b7 agent:Hermes \u00b7 request data \u00b7 requested",
